    "body": "**Requested owner Safari preview for PR #431 (2026-10-30): NOT YET DEPLOYED.**\n\nTarget is an isolated, temporary, publicly reachable *static* preview of exact PR HEAD `f5c6e90d04109e674918d1041a3f8593049f627c` for physical iPhone Safari acceptance, **not** a production deployment or merge. GitHub `main`, PR #431 and #453 source, and other Cloudflare projects must remain untouched.\n\nAttempted Cloudflare Pages new isolated Git-connected project `asynchronia-pr431-safari-preview` under the owner's connected Cloudflare account. Cloudflare API returned **HTTP 401 / 8000011**: `There is an internal issue with your Cloudflare Pages Git installation`. Readback confirmed no new project was created; the only existing Cloudflare Pages project is `asynchronia-chat03-client-staging`, which must not be modified. No deploy/merge happened.\n\n**Next Codex execution:** produce an isolated temporary static build from the exact PR commit `f5c6e90d04109e674918d1041a3f8593049f627c`, preserving the path expected by `docs/index.html` (`<base href=\"/AsyncScene/\">`). **Disable outbound telemetry and any production backend connections in the generated *preview copy only***: PR's `docs/telemetry-config.js` currently has `enabled: true` and points to `asynchronia-telemetry-private-alpha.raykhalit.workers.dev/v1/events`. Do not alter tracked source files or secret storage. Prefer Cloudflare Pages **Direct Upload** via authorized Wrangler login / API rather than Git source integration; use a uniquely named isolated project with no DB/Worker bindings, verify exact commit marker and all JS/CSS assets, and open the resulting URL on desktop. If credentials or host restrictions prevent this, stop with precise blocker and do not invent a link. Public preview URL and cleanup procedure should be returned for user's real-iPhone Safari checks, explicitly no native Safari PASS yet. Never touch staging Chat03, merge, or production. GitHub CI 40918435603 succeeded but doesn't substitute for Safari test.",
